/-- `TV_{[0,T]} h` as a real number (L3997). Meaningful for data with finite variation, e.g. AC data on `[0,T]`;
every use in the anchors is guarded by `AbsolutelyContinuousOnInterval h 0 T` (the value `0` for infinite variation
is then never reached). -/
noncomputable def datumVar (h : ℝ → ℂ) (T : ℝ) : ℝ := (eVariationOn h (Icc 0 T)).toReal

